1.1.1 2026-10-26
  - sourcedata/sourcedata_provenance.json: each of the 853 source files now carries the MOABB
    subject id (1-20) it belongs to, taken from its S## path token, so a per-subject MOABB load
    fetches only that subject's files. File paths, byte counts and SHA-256 values are unchanged;
    no recording or source file changed.
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.1.0 -> 1.1.1.

1.1.0 2026-10-14
  - Regenerated all BIDS recordings with the corrected MOABB Zhou2020 loader
    (https://github.com/NeuroTechX/moabb/pull/1269, issue
    https://github.com/NeuroTechX/moabb/issues/1120).
    Subjects 1-12 (41-electrode cap): versions up to 1.0.3 named the channels
    EEG1..EEG41 and kept only the first 41 of the 45 data columns, so hEOG,
    vEOG, M1 and M2 were stored as EEG27-EEG30 and POz, PO4, Oz and F6 were
    missing. Files now have 45 channels: the 41 EEG electrodes with their real
    names (F3 ... F6), hEOG/vEOG typed EOG and the M1/M2 mastoids typed MISC,
    plus electrode positions (space-CapTrak electrodes/coordsystem files).
    Subjects 13-20 (26 electrodes): hEOG/vEOG added as EOG channels (28 per
    file). Sampling rate (500 Hz), EEG values, events (33,534) and the list of
    recordings are unchanged.
  - README regenerated from the corrected loader metadata (channel names,
    IEEE DataPort reference doi:10.21227/f1c7-7x89);
    code/Zhou2020.metadata.yaml updated.
  - Kept from 1.0.3 where the regenerated copy differed only cosmetically: all
    *_events.tsv and *_scans.tsv (identical apart from a UTF-8 BOM),
    *_channels.json (free-text description, still accurate) and the
    coordsystem/electrodes.json of subjects 13-20 (float rounding), so the
    change stays within GitHub's pull-request limits.
  - code/Zhou2020.metadata.yaml: the loader metadata the README is generated from; its channel list and counts
    (41 -> 41 EEG + 2 EOG) follow the corrected loader. It documents the data and does not run in any pipeline.
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.3 -> 1.1.0 (minor: channels added and renamed); GeneratedBy MOABB at
    develop 052ad54 (NeuroTechX/moabb#1269 merged).
  - sourcedata/ unchanged.

1.0.3 2026-08-20
  - sourcedata/sourcedata_provenance.json: removed the per-file subject attribution (every file had been stamped with the
    dataset's last subject; per-file attribution is not derivable for this dataset). PR #3.

1.0.2 2026-08-18
  - sourcedata/sourcedata_provenance.json: subject recorded for each sourcedata file. PR #2.

1.0.1 2026-08-12
  - Added sourcedata/: the original upstream distribution retrieved via MOABB (Zhou2020), with provenance and SHA-256
    checksums. PR #1.

1.0.0 2026-06-17
  - Initial NEMAR release: BIDS conversion of Zhou et al. 2021 (7-day motor imagery BCI) with MOABB 1.5.0.
